 Meet One Of Our A-Team

 Joining Automat-it means becoming part of an exceptional international culture, whether you’re working from one of our offices or remotely. With a offices across the world, we’ve formed a truly global team that thrives on diversity. Our workforce comes from a multitude of backgrounds, and we not only embrace but celebrate this diversity across all our offices worldwide.

