About the Company

Blackfluo.ai is a 100% fully remote company with teams located around the world. We specialize in developing SaaS solutions for businesses and recruitment consulting firms. Our mission is to revolutionize sourcing and recruitment processes with a cutting-edge AI assistant.

Join an innovative team and help reshape the future of recruitment! At Blackfluo.ai, we streamline recruitment by automating time-consuming tasks like research and sourcing. This allows our clients to focus on what truly matters: building meaningful connections with top talent and their business partners.

Apply Now

Content Manager

Apply Now

Remote

Job Type

Full Time

Workspace

Hybrid

About the Role

We are looking for a passionate and creative Content Manager to join our team. The ideal candidate will be responsible for creating, managing, and optimizing all content related to our products and services. This role is essential for strengthening our market presence and educating our clients on how to use our AI technology.

Responsibilities

Develop a content strategy aligned with the company's objectives and client needs.
Create, edit, and publish blog posts, case studies, white papers, and other marketing content.
Collaborate with marketing, product, and sales teams to ensure content meets market requirements.
Optimize content for SEO and improve our brand's online visibility.
Manage social media and engage with our community to promote our content.
Analyze content performance and adjust strategies accordingly.
Stay informed about industry trends and best practices in content and recruitment.

Qualifications

Degree in Marketing, Communication, Journalism, or a related field.
Previous experience in content management, preferably in the tech or recruitment sector.
Excellent writing and communication skills.
Knowledge of content management tools and digital marketing platforms.
SEO and data analysis skills.
Ability to work independently and manage multiple projects simultaneously.

Why Join Blackfluo.ai?

By joining our team, you will have the opportunity to work in a dynamic and innovative environment. You will contribute to transforming the recruitment landscape with our AI technology while developing your skills in a rapidly evolving sector.

How to Apply

If you are passionate about content and want to be part of a company that is revolutionizing recruitment, send your resume and cover letter to contact@blackfluo.ai.

