About the Company

Blackfluo.ai is a 100% fully remote company with teams located around the world. We specialize in developing SaaS solutions for businesses and recruitment consulting firms. Our mission is to revolutionize sourcing and recruitment processes with a cutting-edge AI assistant.

Join an innovative team and help reshape the future of recruitment! At Blackfluo.ai, we streamline recruitment by automating time-consuming tasks like research and sourcing. This allows our clients to focus on what truly matters: building meaningful connections with top talent and their business partners.

