 Here at Chubb Fire & Security, we don’t just say we value our people – we prove it every day. We're currently hiring a Commercial Sales Consultant with experience in Fire or Security systems to join our growing team in the North East Region.

This is more than just a sales role. You'll be the face of Chubb for new and existing B2B clients, offering tailored fire detection, prevention, and electronic security solutions, including CCTV, Access Control, and Intruder Alarms.

What we can offer

• Competitive salary up to £45,000 based on experience

• Uncapped OTE – realistic earnings of £75,000+

• Company vehicle or car allowance

• 25 days holiday plus bank holidays (option to purchase extra annua leave)

• Ongoing training & development

• Company pension scheme

• Life assurance – 4x your basic salary

• £1,000 employee referral scheme

• Access to a wide range of employee discounts via our central benefits platform

• Health & wellbeing resources

• Bravo Awards – recognising and celebrating outstanding contributions

• Employee Scholarship Programme – supporting your long-term growth

What You’ll Be Doing

• Driving sales across a defined territory of the North East.

• Promoting the full range of Chubb’s fire safety and electronic security solutions

• Managing existing accounts while developing and driving new business opportunities

• Offering expert, consultative advice that puts customers’ safety and peace of mind first

What We’re Looking For

• Proven track record in Sales ideally in a technical environment.

• Technical knowledge of fire safety systems OR a strong background in electronic security sales would be advantageous.

• Experience in solution-based sales

• Account management and new business development success

• Strong territory management and strategic sales planning skills

• A valid UK driving licence

Whether you're a seasoned sales professional or a technically minded engineer looking to step into a consultative role, we’d love to hear from you

More about Chubb Fire and Security

Creating solutions for people and our planet, our company values are our absolutes –

• Own what we do

• Protect people first.

• Think Steps ahead

• Bring energy to challenges

• Win with integrity, together.

• 

We work and win together, while never compromising our values.

