• Responding to Service Calls: Engineers respond to customer requests for service, troubleshooting issues and resolving problems promptly to maintain customer satisfaction and safety

• Participate in a structured call-out rota to provide after-hours support, ensuring timely responses to urgent issues on a rotational schedule

