 We are seeking a highly skilled Senior Full Stack Developer with Tech Lead capabilities to join our team on a key new account win operating in the utilities sector. This is not simply a delivery role - it requires someone who will genuinely embed themselves within our client’s organisation, developing a deep understanding of their industry, their regulatory environment, and their operational pressures.
You will be a confident, solution-oriented technical lead with hands-on delivery responsibilities. You will lead client discussions, scope projects accurately, and support developers across multiple workstreams - from ongoing maintenance and security updates through to medium- and large-scale builds and integrations. Above all, you will bring the credibility and curiosity needed to become a trusted technical partner to a client operating in a highly regulated environment.

