 Technical Leadership
• Lead the technical direction of projects, solving complex challenges and ensuring best practices are upheld within regulated, enterprise-grade environments.

• Act as the primary technical point of contact for clients, confidently guiding them through issues, options, and solutions —-with sensitivity to the compliance and operational constraints of their sector.

• Proactively recognize and communicate knowledge gaps, escalating where needed, while promoting a culture of learning within the team.

