 Client Embedding & Industry Understanding
• Invest time in genuinely understanding the client’s business, their regulatory landscape, and the pressures facing their sector.

• Build credibility with both technical and non-technical stakeholders by speaking the language of the industry, not just the language of technology.

• Identify how digital capabilities can address real operational or compliance challenges specific to the client’s context.

• Represent FreelyGive as a long-term strategic partner, not just a supplier.

