Our client is a well-established and rapidly growing Sweepstakes Casino operator with a strong reputation for innovation, player experience, and commercial success. 

• Operating across multiple international markets, they have built a high-performing business centered around technology, data-driven decision making, and premium casino entertainment. 

• As they continue to scale, they are seeking talented professionals who thrive in fast-paced environments and want to play a key role in shaping the future growth of the organization. 

