about the role

We are seeking an experienced Sales/Business Developer for EA Solutions to drive revenue growth and expand market presence for our Enterprise Architect solutions. The ideal candidate will possess a deep understanding of enterprise architecture principles, coupled with a proven track record of success in B2B sales and business development within the technology sector. This role requires a strategic thinker with exceptional communication skills and the ability to cultivate strong relationships with key stakeholders across various industries.

