 As an AI Developer, you will design and implement probabilistic inference and control architectures for robotic platforms based on principles of active inference and embodied cognition. 
You’ll work closely with researchers, roboticists, and embedded systems engineers to develop intelligent, adaptive behaviours for unmanned ground, air, and marine systems. 
As a specialist programmer, you will have the opportunity to work on ground-breaking projects and collaborate with world-class experts in the emerging Active Inference AI field.

