 • 

 AI Development

 Develop and implement active inference algorithms for decision-making, navigation, and control.

 • 

 Integrate AI Models with Robotic Platforms

 Integrate AI models with real-time robotic platforms, focusing on sensor fusion, planning, and adaptive control.

 • 

 Collaborate with AI Hardware Engineers

 Collaborate with hardware engineers to optimise algorithms for embedded and edge computing architectures.

 • 

 Data Analysis

 Analyse data from robotic systems to refine models and improve robustness under uncertainty.

 • 

 Shape Stanhope's Long-Term AI Strategy

 Contribute to system architecture and help define the long-term AI strategy for the company.

